---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mental Health Awareness" description="The SRO's efforts in raising mental health awareness in Jewish communities.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1>Gentle Mental Health Awareness</h1>
    <p>The SRO's efforts in raising mental health awareness in our Jewish communities</p>
    <div class="gold-rule"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mh-intro">
        <div class="mh-text">
          <h2 class="section-title">Our Commitment</h2>
          <div class="gold-divider"></div>
          <p>
            Stay updated and find out more about the SRO's efforts in raising mental health awareness
            in our Jewish communities. Rabbi Dweck has been a passionate advocate for addressing mental
            health with sensitivity, wisdom, and the lens of Jewish tradition.
          </p>
          <p>
            Through publications, community events, and training programmes, the Senior Rabbi's Office
            is committed to ensuring that mental health is treated with the seriousness and compassion
            it deserves within our community.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mh-img">
          <img
            src="/images/4959e2_2b10f93487cc4a488a17da54a81f2cd7.jpg"
            alt="Mental Health Awareness"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Resources &amp; Initiatives</h2>
      <div class="gold-divider"></div>
      <div class="mh-resources">

        <a
          href="https://www.rabbijosephdweck.com/_files/ugd/4959e2_713ff94bb8734380b6d908bfdfe79d4a.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="resource-card"
        >
          <div class="resource-icon">📄</div>
          <div class="resource-body">
            <h3>Rabbi Dweck on Mental Health Awareness Week 2022</h3>
            <p>Rabbi Dweck's statement and reflections on Mental Health Awareness Week, exploring Judaism's approach to mental wellbeing.</p>
            <span class="btn" style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:0.78rem;">Read Document →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/course" class="resource-card">
          <div class="resource-icon">🎓</div>
          <div class="resource-body">
            <h3>Judaism &amp; Mental Health Tour — Rabbi Yoni Rosensweig in London</h3>
            <p>Rabbi Yoni Rosensweig's groundbreaking visit to London to address the intersection of Judaism, mental health, and Halakha.</p>
            <span class="btn" style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:0.78rem;">Learn More →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/course" class="resource-card">
          <div class="resource-icon">📚</div>
          <div class="resource-body">
            <h3>Training Course: Mental Health &amp; Halakha</h3>
            <p>An 8-day training course in London for rabbis and community leaders on navigating mental health challenges through the lens of Jewish law.</p>
            <span class="btn" style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:0.78rem;">View Course →</span>
          </div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--dark);">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2 class="section-title" style="color:var(--cream);">Stay Updated</h2>
      <div class="gold-divider" style="margin:0.5rem auto 1.5rem;"></div>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); max-width:520px; margin:0 auto 2rem;">
        Subscribe to receive updates on mental health initiatives and resources from Rabbi Dweck's office.
      </p>
      <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/HONcznKDXy6KqXHI2Hptoj" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-solid">Join WhatsApp Community →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .mh-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .mh-text p { color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .mh-img img {
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--cream-dark);
  }

  .mh-resources { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .resource-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    border: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--white);
    transition: box-shadow 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
  }
  .resource-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); transform: translateX(4px); }
  .resource-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; padding-top: 0.25rem; }
  .resource-body h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: var(--dark); }
  .resource-body p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mh-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .resource-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .resource-icon { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
